### List files (verify it appears)
POST {{artel_url}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{mcp_token}}

{
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_files"
  },
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2
}

### Read the file back
POST {{artel_url}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{mcp_token}}

{
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "read_file",
    "arguments": {
      "path": "hello.md"
    }
  },
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3
}
